      "question_type": "solution",
      "choice_mode": "",
      "section_heading_before": "",
      "question_markdown": "18. (17分) 已知关于 $x$ 的不等式 $(ax-1)(x+1)>0$.\n(1) 若此不等式的解集为 $\\left\\{x \\mid -1 < x < -\\frac{1}{2}\\right\\}$，求实数 $a$ 的值；\n(2) 若 $a \\in \\mathbf{R}$，解这个关于 $x$ 的不等式；\n(3) 已知 $y_1 = 4x_1^2 + 3$，$y_2 = ax_2 + 5 - a (a>0)$，若对任意的 $x_1 \\in \\{x \\mid 1 \\le x \\le 2\\}$，总存在 $x_2 \\in \\{x \\mid -1 \\le x \\le 2\\}$，使得 $y_1 = y_2$ 成立，求实数 $a$ 的取值范围.",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C001"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v3",
        "symbol_audit_target_count": 0,
        "symbol_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_version": "figure_audit_v1",
        "figure_audit_target_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_observations": [],
        "lint_actions": [
          "kept_first_pass_answer_byte_exact"
        ],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/test_runs/04-api2-triple-average/qwen3.7-plus/workflow/page29/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "(1) 由题可知 $-1, -\\frac{1}{2}$ 为方程的两根.\n可得 $\\frac{1}{a} = -\\frac{1}{2}$，即 $a=-2$.\n\n(2) 当 $a=0$ 时，$-x-1>0$.\n当 $a<0$ 时. ① $a=-1$. $\\varnothing$\n② $a<-1, \\frac{1}{a} > -1$. $\\left\\{x \\mid -1 < x < \\frac{1}{a}\\right\\}$\n③ $-1 < a < 0, \\frac{1}{a} < -1$. $\\left\\{x \\mid \\frac{1}{a} < x < -1\\right\\}$.\n\n(3) 当 $x_1 \\in \\{x \\mid 1 \\le x \\le 2\\}$ 时，则 $\\{y_1\\}$ 使 $y_1 \\in [7, 19]$.\n$\\because y_1 = y_2$.\n$\\therefore y_{2\\max} = 19, y_{2\\min} = 7$.\n$\\because x_2 \\in \\{x \\mid -1 \\le x \\le 2\\}$.\n$\\therefore y_{2\\max} = 2a + 5 - a = a + 5$.\n$y_{1\\min} = -a + 5 - a = -2a + 5$.\n$\\therefore \\begin{cases} a+5 \\ge 19 & a \\ge 14 \\\\ -2a+5 \\le 7 & a \\ge -1 \\end{cases}$\n综上，$a$ 的取值范围为 $\\{a \\mid a \\ge 14\\}$.",
